# =====================================================================================
# EN: Requests to test the whole flow of the API from Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client).
#     Replace the ids ({{employeeId}}, {{credentialId}}...) with the values returned by the API.
# ES: Peticiones para probar todo el flujo de la API desde Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client).
#     Reemplace los ids ({{employeeId}}, {{credentialId}}...) con los valores que retorna la API.
# =====================================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@employeeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@credentialId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@accessPointId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### EN: 1. List the enabled access points (created automatically at startup)
### ES: 1. Listar los puntos de acceso habilitados (se crean automáticamente al iniciar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points?isEnabled=true

### EN: 2. Register an access point / ES: 2. Registrar un punto de acceso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WAREHOUSE-02",
  "name": "Cold storage warehouse",
  "type": "Warehouse",
  "description": "Refrigerated products"
}

### EN: 3. Register an employee / ES: 3. Registrar un empleado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1037654321",
  "firstNames": "Juan Pablo",
  "lastNames": "Robledo Urrego",
  "email": "juan.robledo@example.com",
  "position": "Logistics analyst",
  "area": "Logistics"
}

### EN: 4. Duplicated document -> 409 Conflict / ES: 4. Documento duplicado -> 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1037654321",
  "firstNames": "Other",
  "lastNames": "Person",
  "email": "other@example.com",
  "position": "Driver",
  "area": "Logistics"
}

### EN: 5. List employees (paginated) / ES: 5. Listar empleados (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?status=Active&page=1&pageSize=10

### EN: 6. Update the employee / ES: 6. Actualizar el empleado
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstNames": "Juan Pablo",
  "lastNames": "Robledo Urrego",
  "email": "juan.robledo@example.com",
  "position": "Logistics coordinator",
  "area": "Logistics"
}

### EN: 7. Assign a credential / ES: 7. Asignar una credencial
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "code": "CRD-JPRU0001",
  "expiresAtUtc": null
}

### EN: 8. Check the credential status by code / ES: 8. Consultar el estado de la credencial por código
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/code/CRD-JPRU0001

### EN: 9. ENTRY at the reception -> Granted / ES: 9. ENTRADA por recepción -> Autorizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-JPRU0001",
  "accessPointCode": "RECEPTION-01",
  "movement": "Entry"
}

### EN: 10. Second ENTRY without exit -> Denied (AlreadyInside) / ES: 10. Segunda ENTRADA sin salida -> Rechazada (AlreadyInside)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-JPRU0001",
  "accessPointCode": "RECEPTION-01",
  "movement": "Entry"
}

### EN: 11. EXIT -> Granted / ES: 11. SALIDA -> Autorizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-JPRU0001",
  "accessPointCode": "RECEPTION-01",
  "movement": "Exit"
}

### EN: 12. Unknown credential -> Denied (CredentialNotFound) / ES: 12. Credencial inexistente -> Rechazada (CredentialNotFound)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-UNKNOWN99",
  "accessPointCode": "RECEPTION-01",
  "movement": "Entry"
}

### EN: 13. Block the credential / ES: 13. Bloquear la credencial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/{{credentialId}}/block
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Card reported as lost"
}

### EN: 14. Access with blocked credential -> Denied (CredentialBlocked) / ES: 14. Acceso con credencial bloqueada -> Rechazado (CredentialBlocked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-JPRU0001",
  "accessPointCode": "RECEPTION-01",
  "movement": "Entry"
}

### EN: 15. Unblock the credential / ES: 15. Desbloquear la credencial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/{{credentialId}}/unblock

### EN: 16. Disable an access point / ES: 16. Deshabilitar un punto de acceso
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points/{{accessPointId}}/disable

### EN: 17. Access history (all filters are optional) / ES: 17. Historial de accesos (todos los filtros son opcionales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-logs?employeeId={{employeeId}}&page=1&pageSize=20

### EN: 18. Only denied attempts in a date range / ES: 18. Solo intentos rechazados en un rango de fechas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-logs?result=Denied&fromUtc=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z

### EN: 19. Deactivate the employee (also revokes the credentials) / ES: 19. Desactivar el empleado (también revoca las credenciales)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}/deactivate

### EN: 20. Access after deactivation -> Denied (CredentialRevoked) / ES: 20. Acceso después de desactivar -> Rechazado (CredentialRevoked)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-JPRU0001",
  "accessPointCode": "RECEPTION-01",
  "movement": "Entry"
}
